      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PYRENEES ACE (8) was a Grade 5 winner two back then out of the placings latest at this track but moves to Box 8 this time where he has performed well. Meets a moderate line up and rates on top this time. RUXTON GIRL (1) hit the ground running from out wide with a fast early sectional but run over late and missed the frame when a 3.5 lengths fourth (23.76) over 410m at this track. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Worth another chance. COMPARE BUBBLE (4) turned in a moderate effort last time when seventh at Geelong over 400m behind Onyx Lass (23.31) in a Grade 5. Expected to give a good account. RIVIA THEA (2) can measure up with the right run.",
